+
+# Long-stay discount
+
+A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price (days x daily price). Shorter rentals are
+unchanged. `quote` and `book` both return the reduced total.
+
+Rule: the discounted total is `full * 9 / 10` in integer cents, rounded half up (deterministic, no floats).
